      "message": "I\u0027m trying to imagine how to make this more elegant. I think the answer lies in adding state to EmbedderTestEnvironment to track brotli enablement, and adding a method to control this value (on/off).  Then you can have just ordinary embeddertests test the no-brotli case, and the brotliembeddertest overrides setup() amd teardown() to bounce the library calling the new method in-between. See the link I provided below for how some other tests bounce the libraray.\n\nI am very sorry that this is such elaborate plumbing.  But these things always are no fun.",
      "revId": "d9264696f827daa8992cb2bffc507c29da173de9",
